# Annie (Mental Model Reference)

This source documents a mental model called "Annie" — a conceptual tool for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. It is cross-referenced to Annie Duke's decision-making framework from *How to Decide*.

The model is described as a universal mental shortcut applicable across general domains, with moderate confidence (0.7). No substantive content beyond the cross-reference to Annie Duke's work is provided in this stub.

